Zenith patch 0001 for NVIDIA Streamline v2.14.16 (625db07d, MIT): no OTA, no updater, no downloaded plugins.

- pluginManager.cpp loadPlugins(): the readServerManifest() + checkForOTA() calls are removed (checkForOTA starts
  NVIDIA's updater nvngx_update.exe on any PC with an NVIDIA GPU, whatever eAllowOTA says), and the block that
  loads OTA-downloaded plugins (eLoadDownloadedPlugins or the driver's OTA override key) is compiled out.
- ota.cpp invokeNGXUpdater(): never starts a process (belt and braces: nothing can reach CreateProcessW);
  the unused wininet/urlmon links are dropped.
- commonEntry.cpp updateNGXFeature(): NGX's NVSDK_NGX_UpdateFeature is never called.

